WEBVTT

00:00:00.357 --> 00:00:08.077
A follow-up review now shows its numbered check as soon as it is due. The card stays teal while the reviewer gets ready, including through a restart.

00:00:09.035 --> 00:00:16.835
Search shows a compact card. It now keeps the same second review check label, making the review round clear even in this smaller view.
